Go client for managing 0xSplits v1 smart contracts including creating, updating, distributing, and withdrawing from splits.

## Key Integration Patterns
- All split operations require precise recipient ordering by address (ascending)
- Percentage allocations must total exactly 1,000,000 (100% with 4 decimal precision)
- Use ethkit for Ethereum interaction patterns and ABI encoding

## Important Constraints  
- Always validate and order recipients before any contract interaction
- Maintain thread-safe operations with mutex locks on parameter structs
- Hash calculations require non-standard abi.encodePacked for compatibility